sanitaryware, tiles). Full furnishing is an option priced individually.","question":"Is the All-Inclusive package available and how much does it cost?"},{"id":"hk113-02-faq-2","answer":"The investment is split into eight stages and the next instalment is paid after the previous result has been checked: 10% design and reservation, 20% machine start-up, 10% factory acceptance, 10% packing and shipping, 10% materials on site, 10% shell assembly, 15% shell-and-core stage, 15% handover of keys. After the contract is signed the price of materials is frozen for the whole construction period.","question":"What is the payment schedule and is the price fixed?"},{"id":"hk113-02-faq-3","answer":"From order to handover of the keys the build takes 4-6 months, with on-site assembly of up to 14 days. The producer provides transport and assembly; the foundation slab is an extra cost outside the All-Inclusive package, and soil replacement is charged at actual cost.","question":"How long does the build take from order to handover of the keys?"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Prefabricated LGS steel frame (galvanised profiles) with mineral wool filling, cement-bonded particleboard, wind barrier and 150 mm facade insulation.', 'Flat roof with an EPDM membrane', 'The design can be adapted with the producer''s architects: changing the partition layout, the size and placement of windows and modifying the building form.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
INSERT INTO "product_translation" ("id", "product_id", "locale", "name", "description", "created_at", "updated_at", "room_layout", "faq", "ai_generated_name", "ai_generated_description", "ai_translated_from_name", "ai_translated_from_description", "client_requirements", "foundation_options", "technical_specs", "construction_system", "roof_type", "customization_scope", "service_scope_description") VALUES ('ee1912dd-6a0e-4dde-a8b3-57cf7686e024', 'aa2f8bac-68b9-5bed-a177-c1ddd817f93c', 'en', 'FrameDEV 7', 'A two-storey residence with a gable roof, upper-floor terraces and a three-car garage, with 262 m² of usable area. The ground floor has an open living area, a recreation room and a suite with a bedroom and wardrobe; upstairs are three bedrooms with walk-in wardrobes. Mechanical ventilation with heat recovery.', '2026-10-21T17:43:49.038Z'::timestamptz, '2026-10-21T18:12:19.833Z'::timestamptz, '[]'::jsonb, '[{"id":"fdpl-z556-faq-1","answer":"Yes, the estimated price of the All-Inclusive package is PLN 2,218,136. It covers everything in the Turnkey package plus the foundation slab, heat recovery ventilation, a made-to-measure kitchen with full appliances and complete bathroom fittings (taps, sanitaryware, tiles). Full furnishing is an option priced individually.","question":"Is the All-Inclusive package available and how much does it cost?"},{"id":"fdpl-z556-faq-2","answer":"The investment is split into eight stages and the next instalment is paid after the previous result has been checked: 10% design and reservation, 20% machine start-up, 10% factory acceptance, 10% packing and shipping, 10% materials on site, 10% shell assembly, 15% shell-and-core stage, 15% handover of keys. After the contract is signed the price of materials is frozen for the whole construction period.","question":"What is the payment schedule and is the price fixed?"},{"id":"fdpl-z556-faq-3","answer":"From order to handover of the keys the build takes 4-6 months, with on-site assembly of up to 14 days. The producer provides transport and assembly; the foundation slab is an extra cost outside the All-Inclusive package, and soil replacement is charged at actual cost.","question":"How long does the build take from order to handover of the keys?"}]'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'Prefabricated LGS steel frame (galvanised profiles) with mineral wool filling, cement-bonded particleboard, wind barrier and 150 mm facade insulation.', 'Gable roof, 35°, covering: shingle, sheet metal, metal tile or ceramic tile', 'The design can be adapted with the producer''s architects: changing the partition layout, the size and placement of windows and modifying the building form.', NULL) ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
